    {
      "number": 5461,
      "text": "Among us are some who are Muslims and some who are deviant[6]. Those who accepted Islam have sought the true guidance,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 573,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5462,
      "text": "but those who are deviant, they will be fuel for Hell.’”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 573,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5463,
      "text": "“If they had remained steadfast on the right way, We would have given them abundant rain,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 573,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5464,
      "text": "as a test for them[7]. But whoever turns away from the remembrance of his Lord[8], He will make him suffer an arduous punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 573,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5465,
      "text": "The mosques[9] are for Allah alone, so do not supplicate anyone along with Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 573,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5466,
      "text": "Yet when the slave of Allah stood up supplicating Him, they swarmed around him[10].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 573,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5467,
      "text": "Say [O Prophet], “I only supplicate my Lord and I do not associate anyone with Him.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 573,
      "ruku": 507,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5468,
      "text": "Say, “I have no power to harm or benefit you[11].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 573,
      "ruku": 507,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5469,
      "text": "Say, “None can ever protect me from Allah [if I should disobey Him], nor can I ever find refuge except in Him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 573,
      "ruku": 507,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5470,
      "text": "I only convey what I receive from Allah and His messages.” And whoever disobeys Allah and His Messenger will certainly be in the Fire of Hell, abiding therein forever.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 573,
      "ruku": 507,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5471,
      "text": "Until when they see what they were promised, they will realize who is weaker in helpers and fewer in number.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 573,
      "ruku": 507,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5472,
      "text": "Say, “I do not know if what you are promised is near or my Lord has appointed a distant time for it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 573,
      "ruku": 507,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5473,
      "text": "[He is] the Knower of the unseen, He does not reveal His unseen to anyone,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
